# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Anvil auto-loads .env on launch (dev convenience). The shipped app does not
# use .env; end users enter the key in the in-app Settings tab instead.
# A value set in Settings takes precedence over this file.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional, dev/testing only. Overrides the Microsoft OAuth client ID used for
# Minecraft sign-in. Leave unset to use Anvil's own (pending Microsoft approval).
# Set a known-approved client ID here to test the launch flow before approval.
# ANVIL_MS_CLIENT_ID=
